hadiths[7]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2159","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aadmi laaya gaya jo pee chuka tha. Aap ne farmaya: Use maarna! Abu Hurairah ne kaha: To ham mein haath se maarnay wala. Aur jootay se maarnay wala. Aur kapdey se maarnay wala. Phir jab wo wapas aaya to qaum mein se baaz ne kaha: Allah tumhey ruswa karey! Aap ne farmaya: Aisa na kaho! Uskey khilaaf shaitaan ki madad na karo! (Bukhari: 6777)"
"2160","[AI-translation] Abu Taalib key betey Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main kisi par hadd qaem na karta aur wo marta to mujhey apne dil mein (afsos) paata magar sharaab walay key liye. Beshak agar wo marta to main uski diyat deta. Aur wo isliye ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use sunnat nahi banaaya. (Bukhari: 6778)"
"2161","[AI-translation] Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein aadmi tha jiska naam Abdullah tha aur use Himaar laqab diya jaata tha. Jabke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko hansaata tha. Jabke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use sharaab mein kodey lagaaey they. Phir wo aik din laaya gaya aur Aap ne uskey baarey mein hukm diya aur use kodey lagaaey gaey. To qaum mein se aadmi ne kaha: Ae Allah! Us par laanat farma! Use kitna laaya jaata hai! To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us par laanat na karo! Allah ki qasam main nahi jaanta magar wo Allah aur uskey Rasool se mohabbat rakhta hai. (Bukhari: 6780)"
"2162","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah ne chor par laanat ki jo anda churaata hai aur uska haath kaata jaata hai. Aur wo rassi churaata hai aur uska haath kaata jaata hai. (Bukhari: 6783). Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Quraish ko Makhzoomiya aurat ne fikr mein daal diya tha jis ne chori ki thi. To unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaun baat karega? Aur Aap par Usaama bin Zaid key siwa kaun jurrat karega jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka mehboob hai? To us ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se baat ki. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum Allah ki hudood mein se hadd mein sifaarish kartey ho! Phir Aap uthay aur khutba diya. Aap ne farmaya: Ae logon! Beshak tum se pehlay wo gumraah huey ke wo they ke jab shareef chori karta to use chhortey. Aur jab un mein kamzor chori karta to us par hadd qaem kartey. Aur Allah ki qasam kaash Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beti Faatima chori karti to Muhammad uska haath kaat-ta. (6788). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"2163","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Haath chauthai deenaar mein kaata jaata hai, us se upar. (Bukhari: 6789)"
"2164","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) riwayat hai ke chor ka haath Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein nahi kaata gaya tha magar dhaal ki qeemat mein jo chamdey ya dhaal ki thi. (Bukhari: 6792)"
"2165","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dhaal mein kaata jinki qeemat teen dirham thi. (Bukhari: 6796). Ladney walon ki kitaab."
